The modesetting driver's XVideo support on a vmwgfx display manager: the
SVGA device's own video overlay stream, as the VMware display driver
offers it, registered ahead of glamor's textured adaptor.  The new file is
the VMware driver's overlay adaptor carried over; the driver registers
it when the display manager reports a free stream, unless
Option "VideoOverlay" "off".  Both build systems list the file; the
autotools Makefile.in is generated and carried in the tarball, so it is
patched along with Makefile.am.

